      "id": "A",
      "title": "挑一挑 · This one, please",
      "description": "生日会上挑自己想要的东西，学会礼貌地说「请给我这个」。",
      "color": "blue",
      "estimatedMinutes": 4,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "A1",
          "question": { "en": "This one, please.", "zh": "请给我这个。" },
          "answer": { "en": "Sure.", "zh": "好的。" },
          "tag": "A Let's talk",
          "training": {
            "type": "listening_response",
            "promptZh": "有人指着礼物说「请给我这个」，你该怎么回应？",
            "options": [
              { "text": "Sure.", "correct": true },
              { "text": "How old are you?", "correct": false },
              { "text": "I'm fine, thank you.", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "别人礼貌地说「请给我这个」，答应他就说 Sure（好的）。一个错项是问「你几岁」，一个是回答「你好吗」，都和「给不给」对不上。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "A2",
          "question": { "en": "This one, please.", "zh": "请给我这个。" },
          "answer": null,
          "tag": "A Let's talk",
          "training": {
            "type": "sentence_choice",
            "promptZh": "用英语礼貌地说「请给我这个。」",
            "options": [
              { "text": "This one, please.", "correct": true },
              { "text": "This please one.", "correct": false },
              { "text": "One this, please.", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "「请给我这个」英语说 This one, please，please（请）放在最后更有礼貌。两个错项把 this、one、please 的顺序排乱了。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "A3",
          "question": { "en": "This one, please.", "zh": "请给我这个。" },
          "answer": null,
          "tag": "A Let's learn",
          "training": {
            "type": "structure_transfer",
            "scenarioZh": "生日会上，你想要桌上的这一个小蛋糕。",
            "promptZh": "「请给我这个。」用英语怎么说？",
            "options": [
              { "text": "This one, please.", "correct": true },
              { "text": "This is one.", "correct": false },
              { "text": "Please this one.", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "想礼貌地要某样东西，说 This one, please（请给我这个）。This is one 是「这是一个」，意思不一样；另一个把词的顺序排乱了。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "A4",
          "question": { "en": "How many?", "zh": "有多少？（数一数）" },
          "answer": null,
          "tag": "A 连一连",
          "_note": "扩充：用本单元数字词 one–four 连线记意思（vocabulary）。",
          "training": {
            "type": "match",
            "promptZh": "把数字和中文意思连起来。",
            "pairs": [
              { "en": "one", "zh": "一" },
              { "en": "two", "zh": "二" },
              { "en": "three", "zh": "三" },
              { "en": "four", "zh": "四" }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "这些都是本单元学的数字，生日会上数东西要用，记住它们的中文意思。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B",
      "title": "数一数 · How many?",
      "description": "生日会上数数桌上有多少东西，学会用 How many 提问。",
      "color": "pink",
      "estimatedMinutes": 5,
      "lockedUntil": "A",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "B1",
          "question": { "en": "How many plates?", "zh": "有多少个盘子？" },
          "answer": { "en": "Five.", "zh": "五个。" },
          "tag": "B Let's talk",
          "training": {
            "type": "listening_response",
            "promptZh": "妈妈问「有多少个盘子？」，桌上有五个盘子，该怎么回答？",
            "options": [
              { "text": "Five.", "correct": true },
              { "text": "I'm five.", "correct": false },
              { "text": "Yes, please.", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "问 How many（有多少），直接说数字就行，五个就说 Five。一个错项 I'm five 是说「我五岁」，一个是「好的，请」，都不是在数数量。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B2",
          "question": { "en": "How many plates?", "zh": "有多少个盘子？" },
          "answer": null,
          "tag": "B 连词成句",
          "training": {
            "type": "sentence_order",
            "promptZh": "把词块排成正确的问句：「有多少个盘子？」",
            "tokens": ["plates?", "many", "How"],
            "answer": ["How", "many", "plates?"],
            "explanationZh": "问「有多少」用 How many + 名词？How many 永远放在最前面。这句没有能换位置的词，顺序只有一种。"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B3",
          "question": { "en": "I see six plates.", "zh": "我看见六个盘子。" },
          "answer": null,
          "tag": "B Let's learn",
          "_note": "扩充：把 How many plates? 的回答扩成数数句；six 取自本单元 vocabulary，与课本的 plates 搭配。",
          "training": {
            "type": "fill_word",
            "promptZh": "「我看见六个盘子」该填哪个数字？",
            "sentenceTemplate": "I see ___ plates.",
            "options": [
              { "text": "six", "correct": true },
              { "text": "three", "correct": false },
              { "text": "eight", "correct": false }
            ],
            "explanationZh": "six 是「六」。three（三）、eight（八）也是本单元真实的数字词，但数目不对，要按中文「六」来选。"
          }
        },
